BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Rescheduled] Qigong
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260728T173000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260728T183000
UID:d6fba6f7ead3edcfacdc82e6@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:[Rescheduled - returns next week] Qigong (pronounced "chee-gon
 g") is a system of exercises which helps us cultivate awareness and connec
 t with our bodies through simple breathing exercises and movement techniqu
 es\, and can be a great way to prepare for meditation. Join us for a begin
 ner-friendly session led by Serene. No experience necessary.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/qigong-28-jul
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Digital Dharma Course
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260728T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260728T213000
UID:eb7da67d2e28d701ac83a5b5@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:The Buddha taught that the root cause of our suffering is crav
 ing. Nowadays one of the most striking ways to see this truth is paying at
 tention to our relationship to our phones. In this six-week course\, disco
 ver ancient practices and modern tools that help us to use technology more
  wisely and clear the way for a more meaningful life.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/digital-dharma
END:VEVENT
